---

---

<section
  id="avantatges"
  class="bg-[#F5F5F5] min-h-screen flex items-center py-20"
>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#0047AB] mb-4">
        Per Què Triar FreshExpress?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        La nostra xarxa de micro-logística garanteix qualitat, velocitat i
        proximitat
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 lg:gap-12 max-w-6xl mx-auto"
    >
      <div
        class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2"
      >
        <div class="mb-6">
          <div
            class="w-16 h-16 bg-[#3BB143] bg-opacity-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-[#3BB143] transition-all duration-300"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-8 h-8 text-[#3BB143] group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M5 3v4M3 5h4M6 17v4m-2-2h4m5-16l2.286 6.857L21 12l-5.714 2.143L13 21l-2.286-6.857L5 12l5.714-2.143L13 3z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0047AB] mb-4">
          Qualitat Garantida
        </h3>

        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Transport especialitzat per a productes sensibles a la temperatura.
          Cadena de fred ininterrompuda des del microcentre fins a casa teva.
        </p>

        <div
          class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center text-sm font-semibold text-[#3BB143]"
        >
          <span>Frescor certificada</span>
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
            <path
              fill-rule="evenodd"
              d="M10.293 3.293a1 1 0 011.414 0l6 6a1 1 0 010 1.414l-6 6a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L14.586 11H3a1 1 0 110-2h11.586l-4.293-4.293a1 1 0 010-1.414z"
              clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2"
      >
        <div class="mb-6">
          <div
            class="w-16 h-16 bg-[#3BB143] bg-opacity-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-[#3BB143] transition-all duration-300"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-8 h-8 text-[#3BB143] group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0047AB] mb-4">
          Ultra-ràpid (30 min)
        </h3>

        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          La nostra xarxa de microcentres de barri permet una entrega gairebé
          immediata. Estem sempre a prop teu per garantir la màxima rapidesa.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center space-x-2">
          <div
            class="flex items-center bg-[#3BB143] bg-opacity-10 rounded-full px-4 py-2"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-4 h-4 text-[#3BB143] mr-2"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
            >
              <path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm1-12a1 1 0 10-2 0v4a1 1 0 00.293.707l2.828 2.829a1 1 0 101.415-1.415L11 9.586V6z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
            </svg>
            <span class="text-sm font-bold text-[#3BB143]">≤ 30 minuts</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2"
      >
        <div class="mb-6">
          <div
            class="w-16 h-16 bg-[#3BB143] bg-opacity-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-[#3BB143] transition-all duration-300"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-8 h-8 text-[#3BB143] group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"
              ></path>
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0047AB] mb-4">Cobertura Local</h3>

        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Estem a prop teu. Servei enfocat a les principals zones urbanes amb
          microcentres estratègicament ubicats als teus barris.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-6">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span
              class="inline-flex items-center bg-[#0047AB] bg-opacity-10 text-[#0047AB] text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full"
            >
              Barcelona
            </span>
            <span
              class="inline-flex items-center bg-[#0047AB] bg-opacity-10 text-[#0047AB] text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full"
            >
              Girona
            </span>
            <span
              class="inline-flex items-center bg-[#0047AB] bg-opacity-10 text-[#0047AB] text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full"
            >
              Tarragona
            </span>
            <span
              class="inline-flex items-center bg-[#3BB143] bg-opacity-10 text-[#3BB143] text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full"
            >
              + Més ciutats
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-20 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#0047AB] mb-2">50+</div>
        <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 font-medium">Microcentres</div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#3BB143] mb-2">30min</div>
        <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 font-medium">Temps Mitjà</div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#0047AB] mb-2">98%</div>
        <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 font-medium">Satisfacció</div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#3BB143] mb-2">24/7</div>
        <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 font-medium">Disponibilitat</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
